sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI
    participant AuthService
    participant PostService
    participant Database

%% Create Post Flow
    User->>UI: Click Create Post
    UI->>AuthService: Check Authentication
    AuthService-->>UI: Authorized
    User->>UI: Fill Post Details
    UI->>PostService: Create Post
    PostService->>Database: Save Post
    Database-->>PostService: Success
    PostService-->>UI: Post Created
    UI-->>User: Show Success

%% Comment Flow
    User->>UI: Add Comment
    UI->>AuthService: Check Authentication
    AuthService-->>UI: Authorized
    UI->>PostService: Create Comment
    PostService->>Database: Save Comment
    Database-->>PostService: Success
    PostService-->>UI: Comment Added
    UI-->>User: Show Comment